{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_title", "source_sha256": "c6f61147b38c3ffb89633114fa81ed7cd3ef793e7284f6a3c6a739ff832e3edb", "ja": "ふるえるこころ", "zh": "颤抖的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bdb487cbbf65ff0b46dca6f4fe2cf2d71b731c74b29171ef8bed6320b437d322", "ja": "センターに指名された紬は、エミリー憧れの\n大和撫子。だが自分に自信が持てないせいで\n思わずエミリーを遠ざけてしまう。しかし、\nプロデューサーの後押しで仲間達と心を通わ\nせ、皆の力も借りて無事公演を成功に導く。", "zh": "被指名担任Center的䌷，是艾蜜莉憧憬的\n大和抚子。只是䌷却无法对自己抱持自信，\n因此不自觉地将艾蜜莉拒于门外。但在制作人\n的协助下，终于让䌷和同伴们相互了解，并顺\n利地借助大家的力量，让公演画下完美句点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8a44343443cf282a4d729836466c8a165192854c54ab85ec5848a5b35d6a038c", "ja": "（初センター公演に向けてのレッスンが始まってから、\n紬はほぼ毎日、自主的に振り付けの練習をしている）", "zh": "（自从开始为第一次的Center公演进行练习以来，\n䌷几乎每天都会主动练习舞蹈。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2ba07185d4260892e2de81506e835e8c8519b629fdb9a775454feb8e30c67606", "ja": "（それは素晴らしいことなんだけど……）", "zh": "（虽然很值得嘉奖……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d770b996baab4f29965bbeec12e4bcee9169693b887e5501174deda9f68bb9a1", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。\nやっぱり、うまくできん……。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……\n果然，还是跳不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f8221357d7616f638d6b60b17d63e446e6676afbf37dc6992501df47eeb4126f", "ja": "でも……、もっと練習せんと……。", "zh": "但是……不多练习的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1004_p", "source_sha256": "028536759b59aa6f93751322cef13c120b36a3a7c627bfd39045e72ed94ba9ee", "ja": "紬、お疲れさま。\n今日も自主練なんて、精が出るな。", "zh": "䌷，辛苦了。\n你今天也在自主练习，真的很努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0be739dc0f8d917ceef613daf4420d060062061e6f1c8f8da632e0818a71e0d0", "ja": "ひ、人のひとり言を盗み聞きするなんて……\nあなたはどこまで底意地が悪いのですか？", "zh": "竟、竟然偷听别人的自言自语……\n你的个性到底有多恶劣？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ecee41bcb63171ad3e172473c6ed882ddcacc125905514117051d695791be300", "ja": "い、いや、別に盗み聞きしてたわけじゃないぞ。\nただ、紬の様子を見に来ただけで。", "zh": "不、不是的，我没有在偷听。\n只是来看看䌷的情况而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1f082d63dbf64a0f27f54f866e658c5763c2de2ccbd686ac1faeefbdc5208e35", "ja": "それより、あまり根を詰めすぎないようにな。確かに\n公演は近いけど、体調を壊したら元も子もないし。", "zh": "先不说这个，练习也要适可而止。虽说\n公演日的确快到了，但要是弄坏身体可就得不偿失了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "542774b224ad602f0c11c4c472663ea032d1f7476a8d40e1417039f3a95baf88", "ja": "根を詰めないといけないから、詰めているのですっ！\nいったい、誰のせいだと思って……。", "zh": "就是因为不得不练，我才会一直练习！\n你也不想想这都是谁害的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "1394b853e7cd944a4b51eae4cc19681ab850f6d1cc2ab98e236a5d41ed3b28ce", "ja": "あっ。仕掛け人さまと紬さん？", "zh": "啊，策划执行人先生和䌷姊姊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "4a2245d4cca81d04f8cd7c253f1cf5f5bdef7937261edf067a9e620c5cc9ee48", "ja": "おふたりとも、何をしてるんですか？", "zh": "两位在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "549bd9f389f6336773522f7e0580419e2d168d0ec0224fed64e62de0b09142b7", "ja": "こ……こんにちは、エミリーさん。\n今はその……えっと……。", "zh": "你……你好，艾蜜莉。\n我们现在……正在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "017b501a610620c32904ee80c21477ecedba427d503cda84d212021a42b526ba", "ja": "まあ、ちょっと本番に向けて、\n振り付けの確認ってところかな？", "zh": "算是在确认正式表演时要跳的舞步吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "079a5f9b54be7239a34a312390121d191bd6a5834a007f8eac12057ea586f7ad", "ja": "あ……は、はい、そうですね。おおむね……。", "zh": "啊……是、是的，没错。大致上是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "b06c86766c61c8460c8c481aef5dfe411b18bd08be3e7445a1edbf56fab9fbf8", "ja": "やっぱり！　本番の舞台を素晴らしいものにしようと、\n片時も手を抜かないその姿勢……。", "zh": "果然没错！为了让正式表演更加精彩，\n无时无刻都卯足全力的态度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "fa7f65b4312fe2a44038bbc45f6152b607cb84e13d69b546665312d9d1be19d8", "ja": "さすが紬さんです！　私も紬さんの主役公演が\n盛り上がるよう、力の限り頑張らせていただきますね！", "zh": "真不愧是䌷姊姊！我也会尽我所能，\n让以䌷姊姊为主角的公演气氛热络起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eb28de753e01a87ac840dbf0207e69380947bf2612e5330f0b91486acc417c40", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます、エミリーさん。\nこちらこそ、本番はよろしくお願いいたしますね……。", "zh": "谢、谢谢你，艾蜜莉。\n我才要麻烦你正式表演时多帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "cbf75939ef2fa92d6d55b6999c31effead781ed7a971128def6f9928f3e773b5", "ja": "はい♪　もしよろしければ、この後の自主練習、\nご一緒させていただいてもよろしいですか？", "zh": "好的♪如果你不介意，\n接下来的自主练习，能够让我一起参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "c18bb0cdce0fbba8223fcd189dc2b6c486ff6aeed75bdb8301f8688f576d9383", "ja": "立派な大和撫子となるために、紬さんが表現する\n和の心を、もっとお勉強させてほしいんです♪", "zh": "为了成为优秀的大和抚子，\n我想要多多学习䌷姊姊展现出来的大和之心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "113b4944838b2ae9cd0bbd1e0b5bb8b95e9b20fa7bac942c93a8c3956797d7a0", "ja": "私の表現って……。\nそ、そのように言われましても、私はまだ……。", "zh": "你说我展现出来的……\n就、就算你这么说，我也还……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "7bd8af5ade606951874c873bae6fcd579152fd96746a30cde48ba2842bb50a6b", "ja": "あら、みんなお揃いでどうしたの？\nもしかして自主レッスン？", "zh": "哎呀，怎么大家都聚在这？\n难道是在自主练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "30579d6f72892c39943fdaa8b2bb454762573070e9094dbee654b6f9aaff29da", "ja": "はい！　紬さんにお願いして、\n私もこれから参加させていただくところです♪", "zh": "是的，我正在拜托䌷姊姊，\n请她让我一起参加♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "45fef46b907cf2569a87f052c7d21fa3c407c54ad22125624a59753a89c84834", "ja": "なら、ちょうど良かった。\nお姉さんも参加させてもらっていいかしら？", "zh": "那还真是刚好。\n也可以让姊姊我加入吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "cd55909dfcc18928604f31a67c8b156989c848120f8eb8a2669563203320027d", "ja": "ちょうど、紬ちゃんと合わせておきたいところが\nあったのよね～。よろしくね、紬ちゃん♪", "zh": "我正好有段舞步想和小䌷对一下呢～\n请多多指教啰～小䌷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "70e25f9941ee8f6f7b852f288c9d56ce920e3de275498f90617b7b995d5c734a", "ja": "合わせるって……。でも、あの、私……。", "zh": "对舞步……可是，那个，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1027_p", "source_sha256": "690f08492937bee1bdaa82e1b1a2066139baeb13f926bd2d5be8de2c46a1d46c", "ja": "紬、やってみたらいいんじゃないか？\n公演には一緒に出演するんだし。", "zh": "䌷，你就跳跳看吧。\n反正公演时也要一起表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6cd74db75876305f0ccf5c2f73f8b061b64480134986a5a13a2cea6d0052e898", "ja": "ほら、みんなと一緒に練習して初めて気づくことも、\n結構あると思うぞ。", "zh": "而且应该有很多需要注意的地方，\n是和大家一起练习后才能发现的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eb6974afea1eda973c546d8db404bdbc5467ec4382387f6e65d3ca80120b944d", "ja": "わかりました。それではエミリーさん、このみさん。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "我明白了。那么艾蜜莉、木实姊，\n请你们多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1031_032emi", "source_sha256": "ef1476153c3a896d09ace55533bd4d9f81b3140e9156cad13560641f205191b5", "ja": "はい！　こちらこそよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "是！也请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8ea85971a2acb819c85be9654a663f2f98128ac35d2cf412c4352f9743478460", "ja": "（どうやら紬は、次の公演に向けて、\nかなり不安を抱えているらしい）", "zh": "（看来䌷对于下次的公演，\n感到相当的不安。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1033_p", "source_sha256": "56b27624f7ea2436cdeeaed706d9d59ec8cb5b179eb18065df5ec5d61b82b4df", "ja": "（仲間と一緒に練習することで、\n少しでも解消できればいいんだが……）", "zh": "（希望和同伴一起练习的过程，\n能让她多少安心一些……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "ea194c13597561ed864c3e37f82a9f33125860649b460ea95d45cbdbd5c55f84", "ja": "ふぅ、いい汗かいたわ～。ふたりともお疲れさま！\nここでいったん休憩にしましょうか。", "zh": "呼～流了不少汗呢～也辛苦你们了！\n我们先休息一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "9f61be8144f8510156e9c2539f022ba7084d691d030fa81b6206856a2d0d039f", "ja": "はい、わかりました。\n私、みなさんの飲み物を買ってきますね。", "zh": "好的，知道了。\n我去帮大家买饮料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e4ea3eeaf6b09a2ad9182a88e9b71ff671618d970eb4edc5ae6aecdca3fb7848", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。\n私は、もう少し、続けます。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……\n我、要再、练一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1037_p", "source_sha256": "6a1bd96cebabd00f0fef450f65f14d610d9fcd1bfbdcdaa4c267c7544e840266", "ja": "紬、このみさんの言う通り休憩しよう。ずっと\n踊りっぱなしじゃないか。無理はよくないぞ。", "zh": "䌷，听木实的话，休息一下吧。你从刚才跳到现在\n都没停过，不是吗？这样勉强自己不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1039_051tmg", "source_sha256": "916b30e7adf59d02bea209335db1a16c9660bb355b5195a0e765bf64c668ef75", "ja": "今の練習を見た上で、まだそのように……\nのん気なことが言えるとは、心底……驚きました。", "zh": "看过刚才的练习后，你竟然……还说得出那种悠哉的话，\n我实在……打从心底感到讶异。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1040_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8bd6a229ea18d7586dd1bd0b0ec884078b828df68b6da50ea5ca571b707aad50", "ja": "私だけ……ステップが全然、身について……\nいないことが、お分かりになりませんか……？", "zh": "只有我……还没记熟舞步……\n你难道看不出来吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1041_039kon", "source_sha256": "7d9355e8c0eb00b4cb5216ad747eaadcf26e868364258628048c63dc97c38875", "ja": "紬ちゃん……。{$P$}は確かに\nちょっとのん気だけど、そういうことじゃないのよ？", "zh": "小䌷……{$P$}确实有点少根筋，\n但他不是那个意思喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1042_p", "source_sha256": "dc2c7805ba6f6baf71cab58be6776e597cf712d8fda8cc7aee46c6d556fff793", "ja": "そ、そうそう。その状態で練習を続けても、\nかえって逆効果だ。", "zh": "没、没错，照你现在的状态，\n就算继续练下去也只会得到反效果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1043_032emi", "source_sha256": "5d4475d64bf85d2929cdf2a4dc934ef9005f8075d666413ec9fdb74bba84ef9f", "ja": "ただいま戻りました。あちらの机に飲み物を……\n紬さん？　もしかして、まだ練習の続きを？", "zh": "我回来了。饮料我放在那边的桌上……\n䌷姊姊？难道说，你还要继续练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1044_051tmg", "source_sha256": "81db94722479b2480e1f048fcb61a8627ef966f354678856132dacca7aae26e9", "ja": "……そのつもりです。", "zh": "……我是这么打算的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1045_039kon", "source_sha256": "5f907d142b7eed49a2dc6d682d01f2b8e0f5ecf9f760b40226d42bbc93dfbb77", "ja": "紬ちゃん……。", "zh": "小䌷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "2fc82e567950b171aa6f62e770cc50719ca48dfc1948c47ba51e38c04cae4627", "ja": "すごいです……。あんなにたくさん踊ったのに、\nまだ続けるなんて。さすがですっ！", "zh": "真了不起……明明已经跳了那么久，\n却还要继续练习，真是值得敬佩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1047_051tmg", "source_sha256": "902e94936c94a2873f8693f17109ab11f598448372b031fe0ed4bf9270b176f4", "ja": "……っ。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1048_032emi", "source_sha256": "edc734bf2042c0f4be02cd8027c67e3cf1ffdd61045ee9c2b3d64b36703cf533", "ja": "私もぜひご一緒させてください！　紬さんの\n雅な振る舞いを、もっと学ばせていただきたいです！", "zh": "请务必让我一起加入！\n我想要跟䌷姊姊学习更多优雅的舞姿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1049_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f4d87c1d13f85947689e178f3a58a8945b6ee1b7a88caa10679e127aa07d8b6f", "ja": "もう、やめてくださいっ！", "zh": "够了，请不要再说了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1050_032emi", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1051_051tmg", "source_sha256": "51b4b1247241eb52928f2497ab5e8cc41c4f6d214a24c66a1c3db95d250ca8a9", "ja": "エミリーさん、私は……、あなたの手本と\nなれるような者ではありません。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，我……\n不配当你的学习对象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1052_051tmg", "source_sha256": "402c9f7c9bfb1179dc6e3fcc46166a87cde9dbbdc128c50317108202d3df2aa5", "ja": "あなたの方が、私よりずっとお上手で……。\nもう、うちのこと構わんといてっ！", "zh": "你跳得实在比我好太多……\n拜托别再管人家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1053_032emi", "source_sha256": "d945d7ce93b5dd96684aa6bef494e198d687942d1fb208298d87acbd3895b710", "ja": "つ、紬さん！？　……あ、あの、仕掛け人さまっ？\n私、紬さんを怒らせてしまったのでしょうか……？", "zh": "䌷、䌷姊姊！？那、那个，策划执行人先生？\n我是不是惹䌷姊姊生气了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1054_032emi", "source_sha256": "f9283a46bdfbdf8a18de1d1e65062c365e552931c8fb4ddc171640f61c2216d3", "ja": "あ！　やっぱり私、お邪魔だったんですね！？\nだ、だから……！", "zh": "啊！我果然打扰到她了吧！？\n所、所以她才……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_1055", "source_sha256": "ffe60289acc10f37da2c0e354959dffcb78ffdd6d8bb6ab5a4973c64187a021c", "ja": "そうじゃない", "zh": "不是的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2000_p", "source_sha256": "05eeda7b1c2725ef9b0865c686c4f0295e8251f8019afae2f4c27af07b8efa3b", "ja": "それは違うよエミリー。\nそうじゃないと思う。", "zh": "没有这回事，艾蜜莉。\n我觉得不是这个原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2001_039kon", "source_sha256": "c73183da0fc3cdeac638a8a2adc8968dbed127fb3ecfab6a3283a35b88a16591", "ja": "そうね。紬ちゃんは、きっと……エミリーちゃんに\nじゃなくて、自分に怒ってるんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "是啊。我想小䌷她……不是气艾蜜莉，\n而是在气她自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2002_032emi", "source_sha256": "cba100048fadb46f3008363b87c50acf025424256ca94b92dc2d5a8a038b415f", "ja": "で、でも……。あ、あんなに……！", "zh": "可、可是……她、她那么生气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2003_049mom", "source_sha256": "490f47a88b1a34ac22fe8d6c7d346467d8d6fda1c530f1cf3ca09d27be0f0f4e", "ja": "……お兄ちゃん？\n今、紬さんが衣装部屋の方に走っていったけど……。", "zh": "……大哥哥？\n刚刚䌷姊朝衣帽间的方向跑走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2004_049mom", "source_sha256": "3a43092478fa46afab2b83d7cf2559cf499ae484b2dcaaf7efc26f6b54fd6fb9", "ja": "って、何この空気？\nいったい何があったの？？", "zh": "咦，这是什么气氛？\n到底发生什么事了？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2005_p", "source_sha256": "2240432d81bd031868a392b5fba2414641eec8e634942e96ce0954f82b9146b0", "ja": "いや、ちょっとした行き違いというか……。", "zh": "没什么，只是有点小摩擦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2006_039kon", "source_sha256": "d8604ac81773e767a71e5c92b69a5aaceefa2d79f1532da1a56b2057f599f33f", "ja": "{$P$}、桃子ちゃんも\n来てくれたことだし、エミリーちゃんは私に任せて。", "zh": "{$P$}，既然桃子也来了，\n艾蜜莉就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2007_039kon", "source_sha256": "fd45ce6aa587e834008ba133cb5be841053bed5f84600cd7ba04c40d4a4e6a01", "ja": "{$P$}は紬ちゃんをお願い。……ね？", "zh": "至于小䌷就拜托{$P$}了……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2008_p", "source_sha256": "298b13602942df7c7842551ec3bb580034abb190d9c5a8d88172b1ce58ce27c0", "ja": "……すみません、このみさん。\nエミリー、大丈夫だからな。ちょっと行ってきます！", "zh": "……不好意思，木实。\n艾蜜莉，不用担心，我去去就回！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2782f7de183532d1564d98ddd466be89f722c949da05321c7954ba1b7de2e32b", "ja": "ぐすっ…………。どうしよ……。\nうち、なんてこと……。", "zh": "呜呜…………怎么办……\n人家竟然做出这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2010_p", "source_sha256": "cbbbe1f5a198dcb0d2f4e0007b56797402285f4f20c9b7e50da3d9da04db0860", "ja": "紬……。少しは落ち着いたか？", "zh": "䌷……稍微冷静点了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "27a147ec33cdfa1d5237ef90b84478cd82da1546489654e6ed975dce6a7adaba", "ja": "落ち着いたのではなく、気分が沈んだだけです……。\nぐすっ。聞かないと……わかりませんか？", "zh": "这不是冷静，是难过……\n呜呜，你不问……就看不出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2013_p", "source_sha256": "5d3a1aeca1a255d6f32697d40ecb5651649e09cf5f1936fb9ead0e3152fcca51", "ja": "い、いや、なんとなくわかるよ。\nそれでも多少、気は静まったかなと思って。", "zh": "不、不是，我多少看得出来啦。\n我只是觉得，你的心情应该比较平静一点了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "978391d9d589d4b716871ccd284ab76750267835f065e41cc254293b4611dc34", "ja": "あの……ひとつ伺ってもよろしいですか？", "zh": "那个……我可以问你一个问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2016_p", "source_sha256": "26bd2906ed8530eed21da7a836e26e7e91698fa8facbc1e4f71a1604196f373a", "ja": "もちろん。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "当然可以。什么问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "99ce92f6973d7ae50beb9df56e618eda46135f00dcfc78a65dae444ad632a553", "ja": "一体どうして……。\nどうして私がセンターなのです？", "zh": "到底是为什么……？\n为什么要选我当Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1a8fc41e6bb98e0bde294c9a9ead5d61850ac05a3e34df3aef72dfda798ed578", "ja": "まだ満足に振り付けも覚えていないのに。\nみんなより、まだ全然できていないのに……。", "zh": "我明明连舞步都还没办法好好记住，\n跟大家比起来简直差远了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_2019", "source_sha256": "24b830a7a6d31e2f782ff74495ef4f6d8ea9b3a7bbee58584fdaa8238aa1607d", "ja": "できてないから", "zh": "正是因为你做不到", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3000_p", "source_sha256": "5afcc455ab351da5ca69f4407c34f74c891cecbdbcb902e37448c27545478d32", "ja": "……紬がそうやって、できてないことを\n気にしてるみたいだから、かな。", "zh": "……大概是因为䌷老是这样，\n一直对自己做不到的事在意个不停吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "73b87ab53bfb994f68f88d592c33884878c0c7c3a1a43218b75582400fb1650e", "ja": "つまり、私をさらし者にして\nあざけるために……？", "zh": "意思是，你故意要\n让我被大家嘲笑吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3003_p", "source_sha256": "9a2d09e5fe9b84e40c6f6199d3dd115c44713fdc268fd160817e9bb74871d506", "ja": "違う違う！　そうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不是不是！我不是这个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3004_p", "source_sha256": "f17a8e1915b8be6b458cada4a6b8adc4e02f68cd7329f5f12c6bb17ed23fcc53", "ja": "劇場にはいろんな子がいる。紬が他の誰かと比べて、\nできないことがあるのは……当たり前なんだよ。", "zh": "剧场里有各式各样的伙伴。和其他人比较起来，\n䌷就算有不如人的地方……也是很正常的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3006_p", "source_sha256": "5a9a98b41723295042e82deef22ffb99e76b933cc3dddc83ef6ff9f3321af5d7", "ja": "その代わり、紬が他の誰かよりできることだってある。\nそれに気づいてほしくて、センターを任せたんだ。", "zh": "相对的，䌷一定也有比其他人都擅长的事。\n我是希望你能察觉到这点，才决定选你当Center的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3007_p", "source_sha256": "1fe8e20f386984c8068cda2fee5cb24afa4b0694acbb9bfd93437f909e705989", "ja": "たとえば……人を惹きつけること。\nエミリーを惹きつけているみたいにな。", "zh": "比方说……你有股非常吸引人的魅力。\n就像艾蜜莉被你吸引那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ec8955163bc5b275689a8ec43ddf69fd861dc0b5630251ae73f17c28e17f89f8", "ja": "え、エミリーさんは……。\nただ、うちが呉服屋だから……。", "zh": "咦，艾蜜莉……？\n那只是因为我家是和服店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3009_p", "source_sha256": "7e22f90fbe5d021f0378501f1fefb510b1ac51acb3fb70f2ed14b20e9294332f", "ja": "そうか？　本当にそれだけだと思ってるなら、\n紬の目はたぶん節穴だ。", "zh": "是这样吗？如果䌷真的觉得只有这个原因，\n那实在是太没眼光啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "28f3d4f5dc8bae5dcf862441a135efc2ace89df3f2544f34c876cfcf3ece3d07", "ja": "でも、そんなエミリーさんを私は……。\n……傷つけてしまいました。", "zh": "可是，我却……伤害了那样的艾蜜莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fc28309e903fa12782ebbb487d98609666c2007f495e261dc1b972454485e472", "ja": "センターとしての活躍を期待してくれただけなのに、\n応えられない不甲斐なさに……耐えられなくて……。", "zh": "她只是期待我能以Center身分活跃在舞台上而已，\n但我对无法回报那份期待的自己……实在难以忍受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3013_p", "source_sha256": "bbbe3ba52005981435b04aa2dd3f306f4aebe3c44641bb2e346254d1111cd6aa", "ja": "センターとしての期待……。エミリーは、立派な\nセンターの紬に憧れていたわけじゃないと思うけど。", "zh": "期待你当Center的表现……\n我不认为艾蜜莉崇拜的，是成为优秀Center的䌷喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "23c9a86a3f9b92b4060cae142fd8a0a06cfdd2143841cfdafc8b0dc3cbabd4ff", "ja": "……どういうことですか？\nつまり、私では立派なセンターになれないと？", "zh": "什么意思……？\n你想说我没办法成为优秀的Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3015_p", "source_sha256": "37639c5cb7af8478d55970098db919fd8e5b22f9135267f2cd62bae9ce85d86e", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。エミリーはただ、普段の紬に憧れ\nたんだ。紬の所作や言葉遣いににじむ、奥ゆかしさに。", "zh": "我不是这个意思，艾蜜莉她纯粹只是崇拜平常的䌷罢了。\n她欣赏的是你言行举止中，自然而然散发出的优雅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3016_p", "source_sha256": "52e69629c5dfecb78e7d300bf2f12b4d983f6bf760bf646e3c6383f9a283cc75", "ja": "だから、期待に応えなきゃって気負う必要もない。\nたぶんエミリーは……。", "zh": "所以，你不需要逼迫自己回报她的期待。\n我想艾蜜莉她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3017_p", "source_sha256": "83e4c916683b92daaeacab4fcda5d33dc62c2312f00bdf0d515bfa0e41d164f5", "ja": "ただ、紬と仲よくなりたいだけだよ。", "zh": "不过是想和䌷当好朋友而已喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ed0d8d37d009084744c3cb2be7fc53923aa40ad75e3360b3355198234c357004", "ja": "そ……っ。", "zh": "这……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b144c4e9a8e2daa1857d7c1342258d1e09ff6f604f9c7f4a5285f5c16e963437", "ja": "あ、あなたがそう思ってるからといって、\nエミリーさんがそう思っていることには……。", "zh": "就、就算你这么想好了，\n也不代表艾蜜莉是这么想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3020_p", "source_sha256": "2321c2e0d08292def0cde1ca676c7fa68689ac01bcb78692b15fa70b9792e99c", "ja": "なら、直接本人に聞いてみようか。\n……ちょうど来たみたいだし。", "zh": "既然如此，要不要直接问问本人？\n……正好她也来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4985afd38aa26c61ab572fc409374f05b87cb84065e72edd3c3a331a3538ed00", "ja": "あ……エミリー、さん……。\n周防さんも……。", "zh": "啊……艾蜜莉……\n还有周防也在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3022_049mom", "source_sha256": "d962957aaa694a5f1157491761db9905962b272735916572a54cfb0c10acf292", "ja": "んしょっと。紬さん、エミリーがお話ししたいことが\nあるみたいなんだけど、ちょっといい？", "zh": "嘿咻。䌷姊，艾蜜莉好像有话想跟你说，\n方便听她说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3023_049mom", "source_sha256": "408a7458f49650a51a3be2d49225f717f789ab44d56124fab533cd31db091bcd", "ja": "ほら、伝えたいことがあるなら、\nちゃんと自分で言わないとダメだよ。", "zh": "来吧，要是有事想传达给对方，\n就要自己好好说出口喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3024_032emi", "source_sha256": "0c40f327731f58e69a758d5b2197fd68ba0a7cd242abcb4f4044a16a9a904638", "ja": "は、はい……。\nあの、紬さん。本当に申し訳ありませんでした。", "zh": "好、好的……\n那个，䌷姊姊，真的很对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3025_032emi", "source_sha256": "6bd096704f285ff19201e0468089f2591f3c0c7ac0d9a7affc6bed37c3c65bb8", "ja": "このみさんと桃子さんから教えてもらい、初めて気づき\nました。紬さんが主役に重圧を感じていたことを……。", "zh": "直到木实姊姊和桃子告诉我之后，我才第一次注意到，\n䌷姊姊对担任主角一事感到很大的压力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3026_032emi", "source_sha256": "50ebf4385de2e37ce056a8f6d5ea519d19bf7f2d6393d7d891e5c24112cc8c46", "ja": "そんな時に、あのように無神経に話しかけられたら、\n気に障られて当然です……。", "zh": "我竟然在这种时候，说出神经那么大条的话，\n你当然会不开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "301e811faa2cd79d02835215ef53c59631b3014b30c032a8e6ffddad37581051", "ja": "と、とんでもありません！\n謝らなくてはいけないのは、私です。", "zh": "没、没有这回事！\n该道歉的人是我才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f5c1e4e0e5b9cf16486ca99a83cbfa3c45c7b0acc2a9c83822cb623b84fed45c", "ja": "せっかくエミリーさんが、親しくしてくれるのに……\n私は思うように踊ることもできなくて……。", "zh": "难得艾蜜莉对我释出善意……\n我却没办法顺利地把舞跳好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "689501fd15a55da16c3f065f98350ce902dc7c41f02b0be08f7a561baa3143fb", "ja": "そんな自分への苛立ちから、\nあんなひどい態度を……。失望、しましたよね？", "zh": "我对那样的自己感到不耐烦，\n所以态度才会那么差……你很失望吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3030_032emi", "source_sha256": "e3a074b85499cf18715df5bbfd80c821ceb01b65f699d94b9a99077e1fa5e25e", "ja": "失望だなんて、そんな！\n紬さんがすごい方だと思う心は、今も変わってません！", "zh": "怎么会觉得失望！\n我现在也还是觉得䌷姊姊很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3031_032emi", "source_sha256": "db8725a8023d03e034d2517b41083d85f658a3b03a421159c5e2bb2f1d8956af", "ja": "主役の舞台のために汗を流される姿は、とても輝いて\nいました。まさに大和撫子そのものだと思います！", "zh": "你为担任主角的表演挥洒汗水的身影，非常耀眼。\n完美诠释出何谓大和抚子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3032_049mom", "source_sha256": "26d6b73f00dbd596299d785988936f77602a470cd365a7579ba207d2cd5a314c", "ja": "紬さん。芸能界の先輩として、\n桃子がひとつアドバイスをしてあげる。", "zh": "䌷姊，身为演艺圈的前辈，\n桃子要给你一个建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3033_049mom", "source_sha256": "0e0492c3313279d187aaddbef0f38f166e77b5e54caf522aebc040ad53a640b3", "ja": "失敗したら、周りを見るといいよ。桃子とか、だいたい\nちゃんとできてるから、マネすればいいの。", "zh": "如果跳错了，就看看旁边的人吧。\n桃子或其他人应该会跳对，你只要跟着跳就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b1bb4b6a9bc0434cf29371f0438e0b9625bf051fc6896d48a60695c9de77ab30", "ja": "おふたりとも……。あの、ありがとうございます。\n……たっだ……うれしい……。", "zh": "两位……那个，谢谢你们。\n……我……很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ce1dea36056557e81ee40039e4e2e22a3ea15ca7de6b4b0f01a8c10e3eb60482", "ja": "エミリーさん。改めて今までの非礼をお詫びします。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，我要郑重地为刚才失礼的态度道歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_004_3036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c9b0b30bee6216ea191ceef074bdb0507280b33da2f794cac4c44d5b7d371af0", "ja": "もし許してくださるなら、\nもう1度公演に向けて力を貸していただけませんか？", "zh": "如果你肯原谅我，\n可以再一次请你帮我一起准备公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
